        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakanyampuka Jeshua mwana wa-Jozadaki, abakwabo bapaizi, a-Zerubabeli mwana wa-Sealitiyeli, abakwabo, nkabela bakayaka cipa ili lo ca-Leza wa-Israyeli, kuti batuule zipaizyo alincico mbubonya mbukulembedwe mumulao wa-Musa muntu wa-Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
