        {
          "text": "Alimwi bakacita ipobwe lyazilao mbukulembedwe, akutuula mweelwe uuleede wazipaizyo mazuba oonse, mbubonya mbuli ciyanza cabuzuba bumwi abumwi mbucilaililwa, ",
