        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwaka wabili wakusika kwabo kuŋanda ya-Leza ku-Jerusalemu, mumwezi wabili, Zerubabeli mwana wa-Sealitiyeli a-Jeshua mwana waJozadaki abakwabo bamwi bapaizi aba-Levi abaabo boonse ibakazide ku-Jerusalemu kuzwa kubuzike bakatalika milimo, Nkabela bakabika ba-Levi, boonse ibakajisi myaka iili makumi obile na kwiinda, kuti babambe milimo yaŋanda ya-Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
