        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kwakanyampuka Jeshua abana bakwe abakwabo a-Kadimiyeli abana bakwe bana ba-Juda, bakaima antoomwe, kuti babelesye basimilimo muŋanda ya-Leza: bana ba-Henadadi abana babo abakwabo ba-Levi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
