              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele bantu banji akati kabapaizi aba-Levi abapati banzubo, baalu ibakabwene iŋanda intaanzi, iŋanda eyi niyakatalikwa mumeso aabo, bakalila kulila kupati. Lino banji bakoompolola cakukondwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
